-- with no ambiguity. Nothing else in each row (ids, titles, photo_required,
-- section structure) changes — only `pts` is added per item.
--
-- Equal-weight checklists elsewhere are unaffected: missing/invalid pts
-- already defaults to weight 1 everywhere it's used.

